{
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_204_bartender_ev_talk.txt/10": "好吃！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_204_bartender_ev_talk.txt/11": "感觉好点了吗？\r\n想买酒的话就叫我。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_204_bartender_ev_wanted.txt/0": "是你！\r\n我在通缉令上见过……",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_206_goddes_action.txt/0": "等级似乎不够……",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_206_goddes_action.txt/1": "\\c[50]<PLAYER>\\c[0]的\\c[52]力量等级\\c[0]\r\n提升了1！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_206_goddes_action.txt/2": "\\c[50]<PLAYER>\\c[0]的\\c[52]敏捷等级\\c[0]\r\n提升了1！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_206_goddes_action.txt/3": "\\c[50]<PLAYER>\\c[0]的\\c[52]生命等级\\c[0]\r\n提升了1！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_206_goddes_action.txt/4": "\\c[50]<PLAYER>\\c[0]的\\c[52]智力等级\\c[0]\r\n提升了1！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_206_goddes_action.txt/5": "\\c[50]<PLAYER>\\c[0]的\\c[52]意志等级\\c[0]\r\n提升了1！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_206_goddes_action.txt/6": "\\c[50]<PLAYER>\\c[0]的\\c[52]暴击率\\c[0]\r\n提升了3%！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_206_goddes_action.txt/7": "\\c[50]<PLAYER>\\c[0]的\\c[52]最大WT\\c[0]\r\n增加了3！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_206_goddes_action.txt/8": "\\c[50]<PLAYER>\\c[0]的\\c[52]连击率\\c[0]\r\n增加了$tmp2%！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_206_goddes_action.txt/9": "\\c[50]<PLAYER>\\c[0]的\\c[52]识别率\\c[0]\r\n增加了$tmp2%！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_206_goddes_action.txt/10": "\\c[50]<PLAYER>\\c[0]的\\c[52]最大EN\\c[0]\r\n增加了$tmp2%！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_206_goddes_action.txt/11": "你的宠物似乎还活着，\r\n不过……",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_206_goddes_action.txt/12": "很遗憾，队伍里似乎\r\n已经容纳不下更多同伴了……",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_206_goddes_action.txt/13": "明白了。\r\n请交给我吧……",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_206_goddes_action.txt/14": "\\c[50]<PLAYER>\\c[0]的\r\n\\c[52]宠物\\c[0]复活了！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_206_goddes_action.txt/15": "\\c[50]<PLAYER>\\c[0]获得了$tmp2个\r\n\\c[52]甜坚果\\c[0]！重量为0，\r\n而且相当能填饱肚子！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_206_goddes_action.txt/16": "\\c[50]<PLAYER>\\c[0]获得了\\c[52]祝福之刃\\c[0]！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_206_goddes_action.txt/17": "\\c[50]<PLAYER>\\c[0]获得了\\c[52]祝福披风\\c[0]！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_206_goddes_action.txt/18": "\\c[50]<PLAYER>\\c[0]的\\c[52]最大HP\\c[0]\r\n增加了$tmp2！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_206_goddes_action.txt/19": "\\c[50]<PLAYER>\\c[0]的\\c[52]最大ST\\c[0]\r\n增加了$tmp2！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_206_goddes_action.txt/20": "原来如此……\r\n愿神明的加护与你同在。",
  "choice/data/event/object/udb22_206_goddes_input.txt/646": "力量等级_$tmp1→$tmp2_消耗等级_\\c[52]$tmp3\\c[0]",
  "choice/data/event/object/udb22_206_goddes_input.txt/794": "敏捷等级_$tmp1→$tmp2_消耗等级_\\c[52]$tmp3\\c[0]",
  "choice/data/event/object/udb22_206_goddes_input.txt/941": "生命等级_$tmp1→$tmp2_消耗等级_\\c[52]$tmp3\\c[0]",
  "choice/data/event/object/udb22_206_goddes_input.txt/1090": "智力等级_$tmp1→$tmp2_消耗等级_\\c[52]$tmp3\\c[0]",
  "choice/data/event/object/udb22_206_goddes_input.txt/1243": "意志等级_$tmp1→$tmp2_消耗等级_\\c[52]$tmp3\\c[0]",
  "choice/data/event/object/udb22_206_goddes_input.txt/1394": "暴击率_$tmp1→$tmp2%_消耗等级_\\c[52]$tmp3\\c[0]",
  "choice/data/event/object/udb22_206_goddes_input.txt/1542": "WT上限+3_消耗等级_\\c[52]$tmp3\\c[0]",
  "choice/data/event/object/udb22_206_goddes_input.txt/1685": "连击率_$tmp1→$tmp2%_消耗等级_\\c[52]$tmp3\\c[0]",
  "choice/data/event/object/udb22_206_goddes_input.txt/1832": "识别率_$tmp1→$tmp2%_消耗等级_\\c[52]$tmp3\\c[0]",
  "choice/data/event/object/udb22_206_goddes_input.txt/1989": "最大EN_$tmp1→$tmp2%_消耗等级_\\c[52]$tmp3\\c[0]",
  "choice/data/event/object/udb22_206_goddes_input.txt/2146": "复活宠物_消耗等级_\\c[52]$tmp3\\c[0]",
  "choice/data/event/object/udb22_206_goddes_input.txt/2473": "我想要食物_消耗等级_\\c[52]$tmp3\\c[0]",
  "choice/data/event/object/udb22_206_goddes_input.txt/2553": "我想要武器_消耗等级_\\c[52]$tmp3\\c[0]",
  "choice/data/event/object/udb22_206_goddes_input.txt/2636": "我想要防具_消耗等级_\\c[52]$tmp3\\c[0]",
  "choice/data/event/object/udb22_206_goddes_input.txt/2779": "最大HP_$tmp1→$tmp2_消耗等级_\\c[52]$tmp3\\c[0]",
  "choice/data/event/object/udb22_206_goddes_input.txt/2942": "最大ST_$tmp1→$tmp2_消耗等级_\\c[52]$tmp3\\c[0]",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_206_goddes_main.txt/0": "看来只是一尊普通的石像……",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_206_goddes_main.txt/1": "你就是勇者\\c[50]<PLAYER>\\c[0]。\r\n深受创造神宠爱的人啊……\r\n欢迎来到这里。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_206_goddes_main.txt/2": "女神像的力量似乎已经消失了……",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_206_goddes_main.txt/3": "我会将你“旅途经历的证明”\r\n转化为“力量”。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_206_goddes_main.txt/4": "我会消耗你的\\c[52]等级\\c[0]，\r\n提供对冒险有帮助的助力。\r\n\\c[4]※等级降低后，能力值不会减少。\r\n[当前等级 \\c[52]$tmp1\\c[0]]",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_207_doubtful_wood_door_ev_find.txt/0": "门上竟藏着一个\r\n传送陷阱！\r\n你被传到哪里了？！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_20_armor_shop_ev_talk.txt/0": "哇！\r\n要……买衣服吗？",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_20_armor_shop_ev_talk.txt/1": "哇！\r\n僵尸也需要穿衣服啊……\r\n要、要买吗？",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_20_armor_shop_ev_talk.txt/2": "你能来到这里，真不容易。\r\n防具很重要，看看吧……",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_20_armor_shop_ev_talk.txt/3": "欢迎再次光临！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_20_armor_shop_ev_wanted.txt/0": "你还……挺能打嘛。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_210_diff_race_soldier_ev_find.txt/0": "你和通缉令上的脸\r\n非常像……\r\n让我再靠近确认一下。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_210_diff_race_soldier_ev_find.txt/1": "快把衣服穿上！\r\n我要逮捕你！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_210_diff_race_soldier_ev_find.txt/2": "欢迎你，异乡人。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_210_diff_race_soldier_ev_find.txt/3": "你竟从那么遥远的地方\r\n一路来到这里。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_210_diff_race_soldier_ev_find.txt/4": "在这里好好休息吧。\r\n只要那片光还没有到来……",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_210_diff_race_soldier_ev_talk.txt/0": "……可疑的家伙。\r\n别做出什么奇怪的举动。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_210_diff_race_soldier_ev_talk.txt/1": "远道而来，你一定吃了不少苦。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_210_diff_race_soldier_ev_talk.txt/2": "只要不伤害他人，\r\n我们就欢迎你。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_210_diff_race_soldier_ev_wanted.txt/0": "是通缉犯，抓住他！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_212_diff_race_man_ev_talk.txt/0": "我只是履行了自己的义务。\r\n之后怎么使用它，由你决定。\r\n你能好好珍惜，我就高兴了。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_212_diff_race_man_ev_talk.txt/1": "救助穷人是富人的义务。\r\n如果一无所有的人也能变富，\r\n最终大家都会变得富足，不是吗？",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_212_diff_race_man_ev_talk.txt/2": "嘿，你这身打扮……还真是\r\n引人注目啊！\r\n有钱的话，我可以卖衣服给你。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_212_diff_race_man_ev_talk.txt/3": "嘿，你能来这里真不容易。\r\n愿意的话，给我讲讲你的国家吧。\r\n知识可是能无限积累的财富！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_212_diff_race_man_ev_talk.txt/4": "……对了，还是说说你吧。\r\n唉，可怜贫穷的人。\r\n多么令人心痛！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_212_diff_race_man_ev_talk.txt/5": "所以，富有的我要送你一份礼物！\r\n别客气，不必拘束。\r\n这是我的义务。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_212_diff_race_man_ev_talk.txt/6": "看来你也攒了不少财富，\r\n不过还比不上我。\r\n就算不交谈，我也看得出来。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_212_diff_race_man_ev_talk.txt/7": "不不，这样就很好。\r\n继续努力吧，总有一天你也会\r\n变得富足，并去帮助穷人。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_213_diff_race_woman_ev_talk.txt/0": "……抱歉，我被吓了一跳。\r\n在你们的国家，大家都会那样\r\n四处走动吗？世界真是广阔。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_213_diff_race_woman_ev_talk.txt/1": "你是第一次来我们国家吗？\r\n慢慢看吧。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_213_diff_race_woman_ev_talk.txt/2": "这个国家的贸易很兴盛。\r\n而且比起便宜易得的商品，\r\n我们更愿意出售高价但优质、有价值的东西……",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_213_diff_race_woman_ev_talk.txt/3": "这就是我们的理念。\r\n这样买方和卖方，最终都能\r\n变得富足。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_214_diff_race_old_man_ev_talk.txt/0": "若不是想施舍，\r\n就请别来打扰老朽。\r\n毕竟一说话肚子就饿。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_214_diff_race_old_man_ev_talk.txt/1": "年轻人总爱谈远大的理想，\r\n可对年老和贫穷的人来说，\r\n买一口吃的都很艰难……",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_215_diff_race_old_woman_ev_talk.txt/0": "旅途似乎很艰辛，\r\n但别忘了照顾好自己。\r\n一路平安，客人。",
  "choice/data/event/object/udb22_215_diff_race_old_woman_ev_talk.txt/200": "我想听城镇的事。",
  "choice/data/event/object/udb22_215_diff_race_old_woman_ev_talk.txt/242": "我想听地下城的事。",
  "choice/data/event/object/udb22_215_diff_race_old_woman_ev_talk.txt/287": "两边都不用听。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_215_diff_race_old_woman_ev_talk.txt/1": "你是从别的国家来的客人吗？\r\n你能来到这里，真不容易啊。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_215_diff_race_old_woman_ev_talk.txt/2": "我能给你的也只有知识了。\r\n想听听前方城镇或地下城的事吗？\r\n客人，你想听哪个？",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_215_diff_race_old_woman_ev_talk.txt/3": "城镇啊。\r\n好，交给我吧。\r\n我年轻时也到处走过。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_215_diff_race_old_woman_ev_talk.txt/4": "从这里往东最近的一座，\r\n是我还是姑娘时去做过生意的城镇……",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_215_diff_race_old_woman_ev_talk.txt/5": "记住了吗？\r\n要多与人相见，获取知识。\r\n这会让你们的人生更加丰富。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_215_diff_race_old_woman_ev_talk.txt/6": "好，那就说说地下城。\r\n这也只是我听来的……",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_215_diff_race_old_woman_ev_talk.txt/7": "记住了吗？\r\n在地下城好好赚一笔，让旅途更富足。\r\n当然，最重要的还是保命。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_215_diff_race_old_woman_ev_talk.txt/8": "哎呀哎呀，是多管闲事了吗。\r\n如果又改变主意想听，就再来吧。\r\n我不会生气的。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_216_diff_race_poor_ev_talk.txt/0": "哦，勇者大人，最近怎么样？\r\n托你的福，我嘛，\r\n你看，就是这副样子。",
  "choice/data/event/object/udb22_216_diff_race_poor_ev_talk.txt/324": "给予_\\c[52]$tmp1拉比斯\\c[0]",
  "choice/data/event/object/udb22_216_diff_race_poor_ev_talk.txt/374": "没钱可给。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_216_diff_race_poor_ev_talk.txt/1": "呜呜呜，肚子好饿……\r\n再这样下去我会死的……\r\n喂，那边的你，救救我吧。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_216_diff_race_poor_ev_talk.txt/2": "\\c[52]$tmp1拉比斯\\c[0]就好，施舍给我吧……\r\n有钱人不都会这么做吗？\r\n那是好事吧？",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_216_diff_race_poor_ev_talk.txt/3": "什么啊，你这个心穷的家伙！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_216_diff_race_poor_ev_talk.txt/4": "咦，你真的愿意给我钱！\r\n你一定是外地人吧。\r\n你们国家的人都像你一样吗？",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_216_diff_race_poor_ev_talk.txt/5": "算了，怎样都行，有这些就能吃饭了！\r\n多谢多谢，你真是个大好人！\r\n勇者大人，万岁！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_216_diff_race_poor_ev_talk.txt/6": "\\c[50]<PLAYER>\\c[0]获得了一次\r\n宝贵的经历。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_219_diff_race_cook_ev_find.txt/0": "来吧来吧，欢迎光临，\r\n尝尝特制超辣套餐！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_219_diff_race_cook_ev_talk.txt/0": "哦，要带走吗！\r\n好，好，没问题，拿走吧！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_219_diff_race_cook_ev_talk.txt/1": "这股香辣美味，你绝不会忘记！\r\n下次再来感受火焰吧！",
  "choice/data/event/object/udb22_219_diff_race_cook_ev_talk.txt/279": "超辣套餐_\\c[52]$tmp1拉比斯\\c[0]（EN+90%，攻击力提升）",
  "choice/data/event/object/udb22_219_diff_race_cook_ev_talk.txt/343": "不用了。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_219_diff_race_cook_ev_talk.txt/2": "辣——！好吃——！\r\n要不要来一份特制套餐？",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_219_diff_race_cook_ev_talk.txt/3": "吃下去全身都会燃烧！\r\n攻击力也会提升！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_219_diff_race_cook_ev_talk.txt/4": "什么么么么！你的钱不够！\r\n攒够再回来吧！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_219_diff_race_cook_ev_talk.txt/5": "多谢惠顾！\r\n我会用极致的超辣美味\r\n好好款待你的！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_219_diff_race_cook_ev_talk.txt/6": "……做好了！\r\n来吧，准备迎接火焰吧！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_219_diff_race_cook_ev_talk.txt/7": "超级辣！可正是这样才好吃！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_219_diff_race_cook_ev_talk.txt/8": "下次再来感受火焰！\r\n愿意的话，也可以打包带走！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_219_diff_race_cook_ev_talk.txt/9": "……什么嘛，原来不要啊。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_21_item_shop_ev_talk.txt/0": "欢迎光临！呃……咦咦咦？\r\n你就这样毫不遮掩地\r\n全裸着？",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_21_item_shop_ev_talk.txt/1": "………………………………\r\n…………物品……………………\r\n……………………要买吗？",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_21_item_shop_ev_talk.txt/2": "欢迎光临！呃，这不是女王陛下吗！\r\n您竟愿意来看本店的道具，\r\n哎呀，今天真是最棒的一天！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_21_item_shop_ev_talk.txt/3": "欢迎光临！这里是道具店！\r\n请随便挑些什么吧！！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_21_item_shop_ev_talk.txt/4": "嘿嘿，请务必再来！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_21_item_shop_ev_talk.txt/5": "下次也拜托你了！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_21_item_shop_ev_wanted.txt/0": "啧，原来你是悬赏目标……",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_220_diff_race_save_ev_darkness.txt/0": "不要啊啊啊啊……！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_220_diff_race_save_ev_find.txt/0": "（……好性感的人……）",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_220_diff_race_save_ev_find.txt/1": "不想把记忆留下来吗？",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_220_diff_race_save_ev_find.txt/2": "就让我把你的记忆全部留存下来吧……",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_220_diff_race_save_ev_find.txt/3": "呵呵……旅途的记忆，\r\n愿不愿意刻在我的心里？",
  "choice/data/event/object/udb22_220_diff_race_save_ev_talk.txt/36": "保存游戏_\\c[52]$tmp1拉比斯\\c[0]",
  "choice/data/event/object/udb22_220_diff_race_save_ev_talk.txt/102": "保存游戏_\\c[52]$tmp1拉比斯\\c[0]",
  "choice/data/event/object/udb22_220_diff_race_save_ev_talk.txt/172": "购买记忆宝石",
  "choice/data/event/object/udb22_220_diff_race_save_ev_talk.txt/214": "不用了。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_220_diff_race_save_ev_talk.txt/0": "哎呀，真是性感。\r\n我吓了一跳……\r\n看一眼就足够留作一生的记忆了。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_220_diff_race_save_ev_talk.txt/1": "欢迎你，旅人。\r\n呵呵，我会记住你的……",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_220_diff_race_save_ev_talk.txt/2": "那么……只要\\c[52]$tmp1拉比斯\\c[0]，\r\n我就替你保存记忆。\r\n你要怎么做？",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_220_diff_race_save_ev_talk.txt/3": "哎呀，这样啊……真遗憾。\r\n我本来很想\r\n记住你的。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_220_diff_race_save_ev_talk.txt/4": "好的，请随意。\r\n这个随时都能使用。\r\n接下来的旅途也要加油哦。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_220_diff_race_save_ev_talk.txt/5": "哎呀，你没有钱……\r\n那么这样吧，\r\n只付现有的钱也可以。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_220_diff_race_save_ev_talk.txt/6": "因为是你，我才宽限的。\r\n可要记住哦……呵呵。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_220_diff_race_save_ev_talk.txt/7": "来吧，把你的记忆\r\n深深地教给我。\r\n你的一切记忆……",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_220_diff_race_save_ev_wanted.txt/0": "是通缉犯，快来人啊！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_221_diff_race_rand_shop_ev_talk.txt/0": "欢迎光临。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_221_diff_race_rand_shop_ev_talk.txt/1": "多谢惠顾。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_222_diff_race_shop_ev_talk.txt/0": "欢迎光临。\r\n我有很多好东西。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_222_diff_race_shop_ev_talk.txt/1": "非常非常感谢！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_223_diff_race_dx_shop_ev_talk.txt/0": "高价、高品质、高满意度，\r\n我们卖的都是好东西！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_223_diff_race_dx_shop_ev_talk.txt/1": "欢迎再来，恰恰恰哩咻！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_223_diff_race_dx_shop_ev_talk.txt/2": "（恰恰恰哩咻……？）",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_224_diff_race_trader_ev_talk.txt/0": "你们来得正好。\r\n我经营的是只有我们国家\r\n才出产的特别香料。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_224_diff_race_trader_ev_talk.txt/1": "带到其他国家一定能卖个好价钱。\r\n你们还要继续旅行吧？\r\n买些带走绝不会亏。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_224_diff_race_trader_ev_talk.txt/2": "再来啊。\r\n如果找到其他国家有趣的东西，\r\n也拿来卖给我吧。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_229_fighting_dog_before_ev_talk.txt/0": "汪，汪汪，汪汪！\r\n呜噜噜！走开！",
  "choice/data/event/object/udb22_229_fighting_dog_before_ev_talk.txt/220": "给予\\c[52]生肉\\c[0]（CHR_\\c[52]$tmp1\\c[0]→\\c[3]$tmp2\\c[0]）",
  "choice/data/event/object/udb22_229_fighting_dog_before_ev_talk.txt/315": "给予\\c[52]生肉\\c[0]（CHR_\\c[52]$tmp1\\c[0]→\\c[2]$tmp2\\c[2]_不足）",
  "choice/data/event/object/udb22_229_fighting_dog_before_ev_talk.txt/426": "无视",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_229_fighting_dog_before_ev_talk.txt/1": "汪，汪汪，那边的旅人！\r\n呜嗷，让我，跟着你！\r\n\\c[52][协力NPC，需要CHR等级1]",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_229_fighting_dog_before_ev_talk.txt/2": "嚼嚼嚼嚼……",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_229_fighting_dog_before_ev_talk.txt/3": "汪，汪～\r\n好——我也要战斗！汪！"
}
